# JSON Validation with Pydantic

A beginner-friendly Python project demonstrating how to validate and parse JSON data using the Pydantic library.

## Features

- Validate JSON data using Pydantic models
- Automatic type conversion
- Field validation
- Easy-to-understand example
- Clean and modular code

## Technologies Used

- Python 3.11+
- Pydantic

## Installation

Clone the repository

```bash
git clone https://github.com/YOUR_USERNAME/json-pydantic-demo.git
```

Move into the project

```bash
cd json-pydantic-demo
```

Install dependencies

```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

Run the project

```bash
python json_pydantic.py
```

